  "production": {
    "fixtures": "The examples recreate a Bash session with illustrative output. Scenes marked “main · c2d62f9e” use additions after the v0.8.2 tag: JSON, removal from a file, mirror refresh and the config-directory override. Both builds report 0.8.2. Direct install, remove, update and cache commands are shown unsubmitted. --dry-run applies to the interactive browser.",
    "render": "From this directory run t3-build python ../02-news/render.py . ~/.codex/skills/explainer-video. Requires the sibling 01-discovery-pilot score source, NumPy, Pillow, FFmpeg, Inkscape, Chromium and Node 22+.",
    "music": "Quiet Index, original composition and synthesis for the Pacsea discovery pilot. The original score is rephrased at the following picture cues.",
    "scoreAnchors": {
      "1": "version",
      "19": "operations-chapter",
      "20": "install",
      "31": "credits"
    }
  },
